
  <sn><md>### Understanding `rclone.conf`

`rclone.conf` is Rclone's **configuration file**. It stores the information Rclone needs to connect to your configured remotes.

```text
                 rclone.conf
                      │
        ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
        ▼             ▼             ▼
     [gdrive]      [backup]      [server]
        │             │             │
        ▼             ▼             ▼
   Google Drive       S3           SFTP
```

**In short:** `rclone.conf` is the file that stores your **remote definitions and the credentials/settings required to access them**.

Each remote has its own configuration section.

</md></sn>
